latch notify as fulfilled seeds no value, but pledge 'notify' yields a value of type 'String' that whatever reads it later needs; latch 'notify' as pending
latch count as fulfilled seeds no value, but pledge 'count' yields a value of type 'Int'
latch lookup as fulfilled seeds no value, but pledge 'lookup' yields a value of type 'String'
latch arrived as fulfilled seeds no value, but signal 'arrived' carries a payload of type 'Tuple<Int, String>'
